//- The featured series on the home (Revision R3, `blog.featured_series`):
//- label t('Series'), the name, a link t('Read more') to part one, and the
//- parts as a numbered list. Not rendered when the series has no part in the
//- page's language.
if themeStack.seriesParts(themeStack.featuredSeries(), pageLang({ meta })).length
    section.home-series
        div
            p= t('Series')
            h2= themeStack.featuredSeries()
            a.button(href=themeStack.seriesParts(themeStack.featuredSeries(), pageLang({ meta }))[0].meta.href)= t('Read more')
        ol
            each part in themeStack.seriesParts(themeStack.featuredSeries(), pageLang({ meta }))
                li
                    a(href=part.meta.href)= part.meta.title
